成的伤害不会触发该效果。\n·墨鹤每秒最多召唤1只，共可召唤21只。\n·效果持续30秒，或持续至墨鹤达到最大召唤数。","descEn":"Summon Inklit Spirits for assistance.\nCan be cast in mid-air.\n\nInklit Spirit\nWhen the active Resonator deals DMG, an Inklit Spirit will be summoned to perform a Coordinated Attack, dealing Glacio DMG, considered as Basic Attack DMG.\n-For 3s after dealing DMG, 1 Inklit Spirit is summoned per second. This effect can trigger once per second. Damage dealt by an Inklit Spirit does not trigger this effect.\n-Up to 1 Inklit Spirit can be summoned every second, and up to 21 in total.\n-This effect lasts for 30s, or until max Inklit Spirits are summoned.","params":[{"label":"墨鹤伤害","labelEn":"Inklit Spirit DMG","values":["32.80%","35.49%","38.18%","41.95%","44.64%","47.73%","52.04%","56.34%","60.64%","65.21%"]},{"label":"冷却时间","labelEn":"Cooldown","values":["25","25","25","25","25","25","25","25","25","25"]},{"label":"消耗共鸣能量","labelEn":"Resonance Cost","values":["125","125","125","125","125","125","125","125","125","125"]},{"label":"回复协奏能量","labelEn":"Concerto Regen","values":["20","20","20","20","20","20","20","20","20","20"]}],"hits":[{"label":"墨鹤伤害","labelEn":"Inklit Spirit DMG","term":0,"count":1,"multiplier":[0.328,0.3549,0.3818,0.4195,0.4464,0.4773,0.5204,0.5634,0.6064,0.6521],"damageId":110504002,"type":"basic","typeId":0,"typeName":"普攻","calc":"damage","element":"glacio","elementId":1,"scaling":"atk","rateField":"RateLv","flat":null,"energy":[0.0],"concerto":[0.0],"elementPowerType":1,"toughness":[0.5],"offTune":[0.4572],"hardness":[1.0],"formulaType":0,"subType":[0],"damageIds":[110504002],"confidence":"high"}],"cooldown":25.0,"energyCost":125.0,"concertoGain":20.0,"unlinkedDamage":[{"damageId":110504102,"type":"basic","typeId":0,"typeName":"普攻","calc":"damage","element":"glacio","elementId":1,"scaling":"atk","rate":[0.4592,0.4969,0.5346,0.5873,0.6249,0.6682,0.7285,0.7887,0.849,0.913],"rateField":"RateLv","flat":null,"energy":[0.0],"concerto":[0.0],"elementPowerType":1,"toughness":[0.5],"offT