nfidence":"high"}],"concertoGain":10.0,"confidence":"high","skillIcon":"assets/skills/1002206.webp?v=1b9b22beaf7a"},{"id":1002207,"type":6,"typeName":"共鸣回路","typeNameEn":"Forte Circuit","name":"妙笔丹青","nameEn":"Ink and Wash","maxLevel":10,"desc":"鹤影\n折枝施放共鸣技能以形写神或重击构形时，消耗【灵韵】可召唤鹤影。\n鹤影分为鹤影·左，鹤影·中，鹤影·右三种，每种最多存在1幅，持续15秒。\n \n重击·构形\n进行下述5种操作时，可消耗耐力施放该技能攻击目标，造成冷凝伤害。\n·普攻第3段后一定时间内长按普攻\n·施放共鸣技能以形写神后一定时间内短按普攻\n·施放共鸣技能神来之笔、共鸣技能极意·神来之笔后一定时间内长按普攻\n·处于空中状态时长按普攻\n·成功闪避后长按普攻\n若施放时折枝至少拥有30点【灵韵】，则消耗30点【灵韵】在场上召唤鹤影·中。\n \n共鸣技能·神来之笔\n折枝附近存在鹤影时，共鸣技能替换为神来之笔。施放时：\n·移动到鹤影的位置并将它清除，然后召唤白鹤攻击目标，造成冷凝伤害，此次伤害为普攻伤害。若移动到处于空中的鹤影，可重置空中闪避次数。\n·获得1层【极意】，持续8秒，可叠加2层。\n·可在空中施放。\n \n共鸣技能·极意·神来之笔\n折枝附近存在鹤影，且【极意】层数为2时，神来之笔替换为极意·神来之笔。施放时：\n·移除全部【极意】。\n·移动到鹤影的位置并将它清除，然后召唤白鹤攻击目标，造成更高的冷凝伤害，此次伤害为普攻伤害，并且让折枝的普攻伤害加成提升18%，持续27秒。若移动到处于空中的鹤影，可重置空中闪避次数。\n·可在空中施放。\n \n【灵韵】获取规则\n【灵韵】上限为90点。\n常态攻击造成伤害可回复【灵韵】。\n施放变奏技能可回复【灵韵】。","descEn":"Phantasmic Imprint\nZhezhi may summon Phantasmic Imprints at the cost of Afflatus when casting Resonance Skill Manifestation or Heavy Attack Conjuration.\nUp to 1 of each of Phantasmic Imprint - Left, Phantasmic Imprint - Middle, and Phantasmic Imprint - Right can exist at the same time, each lasting for 15s.\n\nHeavy Attack - Conjuration\nThe 5 moves below consume STA to perform Conjuration to attack the target, dealing Glacio DMG.\n-Hold the Normal Attack button shortly after Basic Attack Stage 3.\n-Press the Normal Attack button shortly after casting Resonance Skill Manifestation.\n-Hold the Normal Attack button shortly after casting Resonance Skill Stroke of Genius or Resonance Skill Creation's Zenith.\n-Hold the Normal Attack button while in mid-air.\n-Hold the Normal Attack button after a successful Dodge.\nIf Zhezhi has at least 30 Afflatus when performing any of these, consume 30 Afflatus to summon a Phantasmic Imprint - Middle.\n\nResonance Skill - Stroke of Genius\nWhen a Phatasmic Imprint is nearby, the Resonance Skill is replaced with Stroke of Genius, which can be cast while in mid-air. When it is cast, Zhezhi will:\n-Move to the location of the Phatasmic Imprint, remove it, and then summon an Ivory Herald to attack the target, dealing Glacio DMG, considered as Basic Attack DMG. Refresh the mid-air Dodge attempts if the target Phatasmic Imprint is in mid-air.\n-Gain 1 stack of Painter's Delight, lasting for 8s and stacking up to 2 times.\n\nResonance Skill - Creation's Zenith\nWhen a Phantasmic Imprint is nearby and there are 2 stacks of Painter's Delight, Stroke of Genius is replaced with Creation's Zenith, which can be cast while in mid-air. When it is cast, Zhezhi will:\n-Lose all stacks of Painter's Delight\n-Move to the location of the Phantasmic Imprint, remove it, and then summon an Ivory Herald to attack the target, dealing greater Glacio DMG, considered as Basic Attack DMG, additionally increasing the Basic Attack DMG Bonus by 18% for 27s. Refresh the mid-air Dodge attempts if the target Phatasmic Imprint is in mid-air.\n\nAfflatus\nZhezhi can hold up to 90 Afflatus.\nNormal Attacks grant Afflatus on hit.\nCasting Intro Skill grants Afflatus.","params":[{"label":"重击·构形伤害","labelEn":"HA - Conjuration DMG","values":["41.75%*3","45.18%*3","48.60%*3","53.39%*3","56.82%*3","60.76%*3","66.23%*3","71.71%*3","77.19%*3","83.01%*3"]},{"label":"重击·构形耐力消耗","labelEn":"HA - Conjuration STA Cost","values":["15","15","15","15","15","15","15","15","15","15"]},{"label":"神来之笔伤害","labelEn":"Stroke of Genius DMG","values":["150.00%","162.30%","174.60%","191.82%","204.12%","218.27%","237.95%","257.63%","277.31%","298.22%"]},{"label":"极意·神来之笔伤害","labelEn":"Creation's Zenith DMG","values":["60.00%*3","64.92%*3","69.84%*3","76.73%*3","81.65%*3","87.31%*3","95.18%*3","103.05%*3","110.93%*3","119.29%*3"]},{"label":"神来之笔回复协奏能量","labelEn":"Stroke of Genius Concerto Regen","values":["13","13","13","13","13","13","13","13","13","13"]},{"label":"极意·神来之笔回复协奏能量","labelEn":"Creation's Zenith Concerto Regen","values":["13","13","13","13","13","13","13","13","13","1